      ],
      "absent": "21 bindings across Linux (8), web (9), Windows (7), macOS (3) and iOS (2) \u2014 note the overlap, they are not distinct names. Nothing on Android, which is blocked: package:jni 1.0.0 exposes no application Context and everything worth binding needs one. 14 names the framework calls are implemented nowhere: biometrics, haptics outside web, NFC, bluetooth, share outside web, tray, and window setSize/persistState/restoreState. See docs/platform-api-coverage.md"
    },
